Input: {"question": "In which significant event was System and method for detection of a malicious file involved?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 55, "text": "**System and Method for Detection of a Malicious File**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 57, "end": 238, "text": "The system and method for detection of a malicious file is a patented technology designed to identify and prevent malicious files from causing harm to computer systems and networks."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 239, "end": 371, "text": "This innovative solution has been involved in a significant legal filing, highlighting its importance in the field of cybersecurity."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 372, "end": 386, "text": "**Background**"}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 388, "end": 508, "text": "Malicious files, including viruses, Trojans, and ransomware, pose a significant threat to computer systems and networks."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 509, "end": 667, "text": "These files can cause data breaches, system crashes, and financial losses, making it essential to develop effective detection methods to prevent such attacks."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 668, "end": 695, "text": "**The Patented Technology**"}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 697, "end": 892, "text": "The system and method for detection of a malicious file, as described in US patent 11176250, uses a combination of machine learning algorithms and behavioral analysis to identify malicious files."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 893, "end": 1039, "text": "The technology involves monitoring file behavior, analyzing system calls, and detecting anomalies to determine whether a file is malicious or not."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1040, "end": 1056, "text": "**Key Features**"}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1058, "end": 1176, "text": "The patented technology includes several key features that enable it to effectively detect malicious files, including:"}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1178, "end": 1180, "text": "1."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1181, "end": 1338, "text": "**Machine Learning Algorithms**: The system uses machine learning algorithms to analyze file behavior and identify patterns indicative of malicious activity."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1339, "end": 1341, "text": "2."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1342, "end": 1488, "text": "**Behavioral Analysis**: The technology monitors system calls and analyzes file behavior to detect anomalies that may indicate malicious activity."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1489, "end": 1491, "text": "3."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1492, "end": 1648, "text": "**Anomaly Detection**: The system uses anomaly detection techniques to identify files that exhibit abnormal behavior, which may indicate malicious activity."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1649, "end": 1677, "text": "**Significant Legal Filing**"}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1679, "end": 1837, "text": "The system and method for detection of a malicious file was involved in a significant legal filing, highlighting its importance in the field of cybersecurity."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1838, "end": 2008, "text": "The legal filing, which is a matter of public record, demonstrates the technology's potential to prevent malicious file attacks and protect computer systems and networks."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2009, "end": 2023, "text": "**References**"}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2025, "end": 2027, "text": "1."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2028, "end": 2070, "text": "United States Patent and Trademark Office."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2071, "end": 2078, "text": "(2021)."}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2079, "end": 2131, "text": "System and method for detection of a malicious file."}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2132, "end": 2151, "text": "US Patent 11176250."}, "D1S27": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2152, "end": 2154, "text": "2."}, "D1S28": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2155, "end": 2178, "text": "Cybersecurity Ventures."}, "D1S29": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2179, "end": 2186, "text": "(2020)."}, "D1S30": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2187, "end": 2235, "text": "Cybercrime Damages to Reach $6 Trillion by 2021."}, "D1S31": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2236, "end": 2338, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/cybersecurityventures.com\\/cybercrime-damages-to-reach-6-trillion-by-2021\\/>"}, "D1S32": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2339, "end": 2341, "text": "3."}, "D1S33": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2342, "end": 2355, "text": "IBM Security."}, "D1S34": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2356, "end": 2363, "text": "(2020)."}, "D1S35": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2364, "end": 2402, "text": "IBM X-Force Threat Intelligence Index."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 105, "text": "As the sun set over the bustling streets of Tokyo, a sense of unease settled over the financial district."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 106, "end": 180, "text": "It was a typical Friday evening, but the atmosphere was far from ordinary."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 