 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1255, "end": 1308, "text": "\"This is the key to understanding the market warning."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1309, "end": 1386, "text": "Our system and method for detection of malicious files has finally paid off.\""}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1387, "end": 1496, "text": "The team erupted into a flurry of activity, working in tandem to unravel the mysteries of the malicious file."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1497, "end": 1661, "text": "As they delved deeper, they began to uncover a trail of digital breadcrumbs leading from the dark corners of the internet to the very heart of the financial system."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1662, "end": 1804, "text": "It was then that Sophia's eyes locked onto a specific line of code, a sequence of characters that seemed to pulse with an otherworldly energy."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1805, "end": 1889, "text": "\"This is it,\" she whispered, her voice barely audible over the hum of the computers."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1890, "end": 1915, "text": "\"This is the smoking gun."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1916, "end": 2024, "text": "Our system has detected the malicious file, and it's pointing directly to the source of the market warning.\""}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2025, "end": 2101, "text": "As the team worked to trace the digital trail, the tension in the room grew."}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2102, "end": 2212, "text": "They knew they were on the cusp of something big, something that could change the course of financial history."}, "D2S24": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2213, "end": 2351, "text": "And at the heart of it all was their revolutionary system and method for detection of malicious files, the unsung hero of the digital age."}, "D2S25": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2352, "end": 2453, "text": "In that moment, Sophia and her team were unaware of the far-reaching implications of their discovery."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "System and method for detection of a malicious file", "scope": "cybersecurity investigation", "claim": "The system and method for detection of malicious files was involved in identifying the source of the mysterious market warning that threatened to upend the entire global economy.", "answer": "the mysterious market warning that threatened to upend the entire global economy", "quote": "Rumors had been circulating about a mysterious market warning, one that threatened to upend the entire global economy. In a small, nondescript office nestled in the heart of the city, a team of cybersecurity experts huddled around a bank of screens, their eyes fixed on a stream of code scrolling by at lightning speed. They were the elite team from CyberSentinel, a cutting-edge firm renowned for its innovative approach to threat detection. Leading the team was the enigmatic and brilliant Dr. Sophia Patel, a woman with a reputation for being able to sniff out even the most sophisticated malware. Her team had been working around the clock to identify the source of the market warning, and they were closing in on a breakthrough. \"Sophia, we've got something,\" whispered her lead analyst, a lanky young man named Jake, his eyes shining with excitement. \"It looks like a malicious file, but it's unlike anything we've seen before. It's as if it's been designed to evade detection.\" Sophia's eyes narrowed as she leaned in to examine the code. \"This is it,\" she breathed. \"This is the key to understanding the market warning. Our system and method for detection of malicious files has finally paid off.\" The team erupted into a flurry of activity, working in tandem to unravel the mysteries of the malicious file. As they delved deeper, they began to uncover a trail of digital breadcrumbs leading from the dark corners of the internet to the very heart of the financial system. It was then that Sophia's eyes locked onto a specific line of code, a sequence of characters that seemed to pulse with an otherworldly energy. \"This is it,\" she whispered, her voice barely audible over the hum of the computers. \"This is the smoking gun. Our system has detected the malicious file, and it's pointing directly to the source of the market warning.\" As the team worked to trace the digital trail, the tension in the room grew. They knew they were on the cusp of something big, something that could change the course of financial history. And at the heart of it all was their revolutionary system and method for detection of malicious files, the unsung hero of the digital age.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["mysterious market warning that threatened to upend the entire global economy", "significant legal filing", "US patent 11176250"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "mysterious market warning that threatened to upend the entire global economy", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "significant legal filing", "origin": "coverage_addition"}, {"candidate_id": "R2", "answer": "US patent 11176250", "origin": "coverage_addition"}]}
